Before writing or editing HTML, CSS, or landing-page JS, read `.cursor/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md`.

Follow its anti-slop rules. For this project also:

- Default theme is **light** (`data-theme="light"`).
- Tokens come from Run Field `lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart`:
  - Light: scaffold `#F4F7F7`, surface `#FFFFFF`, surfaceAlt `#E8EEEE`, border `#D5DEDE`, text `#040F0F`, secondary `#3D4848`, muted `#7E8484`
  - Brand cyan `#1BFDD2`, on-brand `#040F0F` (never white text on cyan)
  - Dark is optional via `[data-theme="dark"]`, not the default
- Type: Sora (UI), Gajraj One (distance), Anton SC (ranks). Not Inter.
- Prefer real app screenshots and Google Maps over invented UI.
- Do not use purple gradients, Inter, or generic “AI landing” layouts.
